WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.680
Welcome to WinCraft, the field studio for aluminium window and door fabricators.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.868
In this video we follow one project from the first site measurement to a finished quotation.

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:14.087
You start in the Studio.

00:00:14.087 --> 00:00:18.257
From here you begin a new project or open the project library.

00:00:18.257 --> 00:00:22.830
The bar at the bottom switches between Studio, Projects and Company.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.431
Before your first quotation, set up the Company screen once.

00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:33.365
Add your company name, address, mobile number and email, and choose your logo and slogan.

00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:35.698
They appear on every PDF you share.

00:00:35.698 --> 00:00:41.566
Under Quotation setup, set your default GST rate, installation period and payment terms.

00:00:41.566 --> 00:00:46.100
Quotation numbers are made automatically from your company initials.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.212
Now tap New project.

00:00:50.212 --> 00:00:58.620
Choose the measurement unit for the whole project: millimetres, inches or feet.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:04.261
Enter the client name, phone number and site address.

00:01:04.261 --> 00:01:14.478
Stand at the site and tap the location button, and WinCraft adds a Google Maps link to the site.

00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:22.460
Add the date and any notes, and set the powder coating shade for this site.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.172
Tap Add window.

00:01:27.172 --> 00:01:31.284
Choose the floor and the room.

00:01:31.284 --> 00:01:41.129
Then pick the window type: fixed, casement, sliding, folding, louvre or custom.

00:01:41.129 --> 00:01:49.478
To set the size, tap a dimension on the drawing and type the value.

00:01:49.478 --> 00:01:53.590
The drawing updates as you type.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.389
Measuring with a laser?

00:01:56.389 --> 00:02:00.522
Pair a supported Bluetooth laser measure once from the Studio.

00:02:00.522 --> 00:02:05.721
In Auto mode, the first reading fills the width and the next fills the height.

00:02:05.721 --> 00:02:07.920
Nothing to read out or type.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:13.410
Next, describe the window.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:23.042
For a slider, set the track type and the glass and mesh shutters.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:33.712
Choose the profile brand and series, the glass, and add a mesh or grill.

00:02:33.712 --> 00:02:45.270
On the Hardware tab, add the lock, bearing and other hardware for this window.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:52.138
On the Pricing tab, enter the quantity and your rate, either per square foot or a fixed price.

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:56.538
WinCraft never sets prices for you; it totals the rates you enter.

00:02:56.538 --> 00:02:58.739
Tap Save window.

00:02:58.739 --> 00:03:03.473
The window appears in your project with its drawing, size and quantity.

00:03:03.473 --> 00:03:05.940
Add every other opening the same way.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:18.480
Back on the project page, the totals update as you go: windows, area and the quotation total.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:26.825
Switch between cards and list, and search or filter your windows.

00:03:26.825 --> 00:03:39.150
Under Hardware specifications, list the brands you will supply, and they print in the quotation.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:42.589
Tap Create quotation.

00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:53.429
WinCraft builds a branded PDF with every window drawn, its specifications and the totals, plus a delivery page and your terms.

00:03:53.429 --> 00:04:03.323
From the project tools you also get the worksheet PDF, your measurement book for the workshop, and Excel schedules.

00:04:03.323 --> 00:04:06.420
Share them on WhatsApp or save them.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:11.299
Every project is kept in the Project library.

00:04:11.299 --> 00:04:21.760
Filter by pending, approved or rejected, set a follow-up reminder, and call or WhatsApp the client in one tap.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.121
Working in bright sunlight?

00:04:25.121 --> 00:04:29.472
Switch between light and dark with the theme button.

00:04:29.472 --> 00:04:35.497
Your projects stay on your device; back them up from the Company screen.

00:04:35.497 --> 00:04:38.258
That's WinCraft.

00:04:38.258 --> 00:04:41.940
Measure, design and quote, all in one place.
